no|lubuntu|casper-iso|lubuntu-26.04.1-desktop-amd64.iso|https://cdimage.ubuntu.com/lubuntu/releases/26.04/release/lubuntu-26.04.1-desktop-amd64.iso|sha256sums:https://cdimage.ubuntu.com/lubuntu/releases/26.04/release/SHA256SUMS|Lubuntu 26.04.1 LTS
no|zorin|casper-iso|Zorin-OS-18.1-Core-64-bit.iso|https://mirrors.edge.kernel.org/zorinos-isos/18/Zorin-OS-18.1-Core-64-bit.iso|44649b97bd307fc4c8529205d098ebbf98575a1e1ba2ee7d7005b697af1721d5|Zorin OS 18.1 Core
no|killbit|debian-live-iso|killbit-live.iso|https://github.com/Action-Numerique-Solidaire/killbit-image/releases/download/latest/killbit-live.iso|sha256sums:https://github.com/Action-Numerique-Solidaire/killbit-image/releases/download/latest/killbit-live.iso.sha256|Killbit - effacement sécurisé
